# Gonzo CLI Usage Note

This file is Ansible-managed by the `gonzo_cli` role.

## What Gonzo Is

Gonzo is a terminal-native log-analysis TUI with live charts, advanced
filtering, and AI-assisted troubleshooting. It works well when you want one
local operator surface that can read files, stdin pipelines, Kubernetes logs,
or OTLP log streams without building a custom prompt pipeline first.

